OL,4,BCalvert-Lewin signs new Leeds deal     
OL,5,Buntil 2029                             
OL,6,GDominic Calvert-Lewin has signed a new 
OL,7,Gcontract to stay with Leeds United     
OL,8,Guntil 2029.                            
OL,10,FThe former Everton striker, 29, has    
OL,11,Ffive goals and one assist so far in    
OL,12,Fthe Premier League this season, with   
OL,13,FDaniel Farke's side sitting seventh in 
OL,14,Fthe table.                             
OL,16,FConfirmation of Calvert-Lewin's deal   
OL,17,Ffollows speculation about his future   
OL,18,Fat the club, with reports that he was  
OL,19,Finteresting Manchester United.         
